Package: flash-usb
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: flash_usb_4_windows contributors <noreply@github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-tk, util-linux, mount, parted, dosfstools, wimtools, udev, pkexec, fonts-dejavu-core, aria2, ca-certificates
